          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">An anti-gravity treadmill uses air pressure to lift you by part
            of your body weight, so you can walk or run with near-normal mechanics and less
            load.</strong> The AlterG, now owned by Lifeward, is the machine most clinics use, and
            sessions are usually booked through physical therapy or as cash-pay time at a clinic.
          </p>
